Case 1.2: Valid Boundary Dates Check     

===================================================
adddate('9999-12-30', 1)    
12/31/9999     

subdate('9999-12-31', 1)    
12/30/9999     

adddate('0001-01-01', 1)    
01/02/0001     

subdate('0001-01-02', 1)    
01/01/0001     

    
Case 1.3: Null input check – should return NULL, not error     

===================================================
adddate(null, 1)    
null     

===================================================
subdate(null, 1)    
null     

===================================================
adddate('9999-12-31', null)    
null     

===================================================
subdate('0001-01-01', null)    
null     

