Case 2.5: Aliases (DATE_ADD / DATE_SUB)     

===================================================
date_add('9999-12-31', INTERVAL 1 DAY)    
null     

===================================================
date_sub('0001-01-01', INTERVAL 500 DAY)    
null     

===================================================
    
Case 2.6: NULL propagation in arithmetic expression     

===================================================
adddate('9999-12-31', 1)+0    
null     

===================================================
    
Case 2.7: COALESCE wrapping an overflow call     

===================================================
coalesce( adddate('9999-12-31', 1), date '2000-01-01')    
2000-01-01     

